      "writtenOn": "2026-07-13T23:29:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, I\u0027m a little wary of this since how exports are added, removed, and updated has changed some since the original DBUS implementation.\n\nThere are considerations for changing the pseudofs that these procedures may not properly handle.\n\nSince this all works with config files, it might be better to just replicate what SIGHUP does which:\n\nAdds any exports that are new from the file\nUpdates any exports that already exist and are present in the file\nRemoves any exports that already exist but are NOT present in the file",
      "revId": "48e61b9d9a44b0b17dbdbdea2d9071222ae31912",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
