      "writtenOn": "2026-07-16T11:47:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I looked into the SIGHUP reload path and agree that it performs a full configuration synchronization..\n\nFor the current patch, I verified that the existing add and remove gRPC APIs already correctly handle their respective pseudofs operations through the existing add/remove paths. For the update path, I reworked the implementation to perform an explicit pseudofs synchronization after a successful export update.\n\nThis is intended as an initial improvement to better handle export updates. Let me know your comments if further improvements needed.",
